    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I just burned my forearm pretty bad with some boiling water from a kettle. It's all red and there are some big blisters starting to form. It's stinging like crazy. Should I just slather some butter or a thick ointment on it to seal the wound and stop the air from hitting it? I heard that helps keep it from hurting so much.",
